presets.json

`presets.json` holds the 187 preset shape definitions of ECMA-376 Part 1 (Office Open XML File Formats,
Fundamentals and Markup Language Reference, 5th edition, December 2016), annex D, as the electronic insert
`presetShapeDefinitions.xml` of OfficeOpenXML-DrawingMLGeometries.zip
(https://ecma-international.org/publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-376/, SHA-256
2f7c868d857c1e3c4b5a6068759fe0e07d77ad58377a6618d1b02ba3507b6939) states them: each preset's adjustment defaults,
guides and paths, rewritten as JSON. upArrow's guides take LibreOffice's correction of the published erratum.

